      "summary_en": "Bel'Veth consumes Void coral remnants, transforming into her true form and increasing her max health, attack range, and attack speed. Consuming the Void coral remnants of a Void epic monster will grant her the power to summon Void remora.",
      "summary_zh": "卑尔维斯消耗【虚空珊瑚残片】，转化为她的真实形态并提升她的最大生命值、攻击距离、和攻击速度。消耗来自虚空史诗级野怪的【虚空珊瑚残片】将为她提供召唤【虚空鱼】的能量。",
