    "status": "listed",
    "text_en": "Bel'Veth Bel'Veth has come out with the scaling curve of Kayle and Aurelion Sol. Her power is rapidly growing across all skill brackets and given her early game is already quite weak, we've opted to make her late game a bit less sharp. Base Stats Health Growth : 110 ⇒ 105 R - Endless Banquet True Form Total Attack Speed : 5 / 15 / 25% ⇒ 6 / 13 / 20% NEW True Form Remora Indicator : Resource bar now turns purple when True Form can spawn Remora"
  },
